<div class="texte">
<p align="justify" class="spip" style="text-align: center;"><strong class="spip"><span style="color: #666699;"><span style="color: #993300;">O.G.E.C et ASSOCIATIONS DE PARENTS</span></span></strong></p>
<p align="justify" class="spip" style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: #993300;"><strong class="spip">&nbsp;</strong></span></p>
<p align="justify" class="spip"><span style="color: #993300;">Les Parents sont présents dans plusieurs Associations</span></p>
<p align="justify" class="spip"><span style="color: #993300;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p align="justify" class="spip"><span style="color: #993300;"><strong class="spip">1 * L’organisme de gestion - l’O.G.E.C</strong></span></p>
<p align="justify" class="spip"><strong><span style="color: #993300;">2 * Le Conseil de Parents Délégués</span></strong></p>
<p align="justify" class="spip"><strong><span style="color: #993300;">3 * Le Conseil d’Etablissement</span></strong></p>
<p align="justify" class="spip"><strong><span style="color: #993300;">4 * L’ A.P.E.L&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<p align="justify" class="spip"><strong><span style="color: #993300;">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<strong><span style="color: #993300;">
</td>
</tr>

